        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "a41972bf-275f-5097-bfcb-4a7702a8acfa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Sunday Driver, Madrugada, MonstrO\n- Music scenes: UK Steampunk scene\n- People: Bevan Davies, Kyle Sanders, Juan Montoya, Charlie Suarez\n- Other bands: Still Rain, Danzig, Bloodsimple, Medication, Skrew, Torche\n\nFacts:\n- On 21 January 2008, Madrugada released the album \"Madrugada\" and announced that the band would split after one last tour.\n- On 15 November 2008, Madrugada performed its final concert.\n- In 2009, Sunday Driver became popular within the UK Steampunk scene.\n- MonstrO is an alternative band composed of Bevan Davies, Kyle Sanders, Juan Montoya, and Charlie Suarez.\n- Bevan Davies had previously been the drummer for Still Rain, Danzig, and Bloodsimple.\n- Kyle Sanders had previously been the bassist for Bloodsimple, Medication, and Skrew.\n- Juan Montoya had previously been the guitarist for Torche.\n- Charlie Suarez had previously been the guitarist and vocalist for Sunday Driver.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
